<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves dips to $5.546 bln to Dec 4.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves dips to $5.546 bln to Dec 4.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Monday said its hard currency reserves dipped to $3.546 billion as of December 4 from $3.552 billion on November 27.</p>
<p>  HARD CURRENCY RESERVES    Dec 4   Nov 27   Nov 20   Jan 3</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	 3.546   3.552    3.499    3.424</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	    1.250   1.206    1.338    1.599</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector     4.797   4.757    4.838    5.024 --</p>
<p>Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
